{"q":"508","t":"Most Frequent Subtree Sum","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given the <code>root</code> of a binary tree, return the most frequent <strong>subtree sum</strong>. If there is a tie, return all the values with the highest frequency in any order.</p>\n\n<p>The <strong>subtree sum</strong> of a node is defined as the sum of all the node values formed by the subtree rooted at that node (including the node itself).</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/7e0f84da11dd9ea2.jpg\" style=\"width: 207px; height: 183px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [5,2,-3]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [2,-3,4]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/2cb994827fd477b8.jpg\" style=\"width: 207px; height: 183px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [5,2,-5]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [2]\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the tree is in the range <code>[1, 10<sup>4</sup>]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>5</sup> &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"findFrequentTreeSum\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"root\",\r\n      \"type\": \"TreeNode\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"Tree","slug":"tree"},{"name":"Depth-First Search","slug":"depth-first-search"},{"name":"Binary Tree","slug":"binary-tree"},{"name":"DP on Trees","slug":"dp-on-trees"}],"s":[{"t":"Subtree of Another Tree","s":"subtree-of-another-tree","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Count Nodes Equal to Sum of Descendants","s":"count-nodes-equal-to-sum-of-descendants","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Microsoft","microsoft"]],"cs":{"a":[],"b":[],"m":[["Amazon","amazon",3],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2]]}}